  "limits": [
    "Separate exporter and importing test process with real raw CUDA IPC memory and default CUDA event IPC. Receiving identity is supplied explicitly, not through public control RPCs.",
    "Ledger ownership precedes the first raw mapping. Metadata validation inspects the declared fixture before value copying.",
    "Cases cover exact host bytes, checked-release preflight refusal, an actual submitted-copy error with failed drain, and partial second import followed by preflight cleanup refusal.",
    "Cleanup refusal is injected before the checked-close implementation. Later actual stream drain and checked native release finish cleanup; ambiguous native outcomes remain non-retryable.",
    "Exporters, producer events and source allocations stay alive until importing processes exit. No actual device/exporter fault recovery.",
    "No typed raw registration, integrated retirement receipt, namespace/storage execution, model serving, DMA-BUF I/O or speed claim."
  ],
